<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>App on Neurodesk</title><link>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/</link><description>Recent content in App on Neurodesk</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Neurodesk App</title><link>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/neurodeskapp/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/neurodeskapp/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="step-1-download-and-install"&gt;Step 1: Download and install&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Download the Neurodesk App for your operating system, then follow the install instructions below.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;
 &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link active"
 id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="macos" aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="true"&gt;
 macOS
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link"
 id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="windows" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="false"&gt;
 Windows
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link"
 id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="linux" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;
 Linux
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"
 id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Download:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/neurodesk/neurodesk-app/releases/latest/download/NeurodeskApp-Setup-macOS-arm64.dmg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;macOS Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/neurodesk/neurodesk-app/releases/latest/download/NeurodeskApp-Setup-macOS-x64.dmg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;macOS Intel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Install:&lt;/strong&gt;
Double-click the downloaded &lt;code&gt;.dmg&lt;/code&gt; file and drag NeurodeskApp into your Applications folder. To open: right-click &lt;code&gt;NeurodeskApp.app&lt;/code&gt; and select &amp;ldquo;Open&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Troubleshooting</title><link>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/troubleshooting/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/troubleshooting/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="docker-permission-denied"&gt;Docker permission denied&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you see &lt;code&gt;/var/run/docker.sock: connect: permission denied&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Add your user to the &lt;code&gt;docker&lt;/code&gt; group&lt;/strong&gt; (creates the group first if it doesn&amp;rsquo;t exist):&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;getent group docker &amp;gt;/dev/null &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;||&lt;/span&gt; sudo groupadd docker
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo usermod -aG docker &lt;span style="color:#953800"&gt;$USER&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;newgrp docker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the socket permissions&lt;/strong&gt; so only &lt;code&gt;root&lt;/code&gt; and members of the &lt;code&gt;docker&lt;/code&gt; group can access it:&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chown root:docker /var/run/docker.sock
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sudo chmod &lt;span style="color:#0550ae"&gt;660&lt;/span&gt; /var/run/docker.sock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This sets the socket to &lt;code&gt;rw-rw----&lt;/code&gt;, removing access for all other users. You must be in the &lt;code&gt;docker&lt;/code&gt; group (step 1) for this to work.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Uninstalling</title><link>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/uninstall/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://neurodesk.org/getting-started/app/uninstall/</guid><description>&lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="tabs-0" role="tablist"&gt;
 &lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link active"
 id="tabs-00-00-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-00" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="macos" aria-controls="tabs-00-00" aria-selected="true"&gt;
 macOS
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link"
 id="tabs-00-01-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-01" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="windows" aria-controls="tabs-00-01" aria-selected="false"&gt;
 Windows
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="nav-item"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link"
 id="tabs-00-02-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabs-00-02" role="tab"
 data-td-tp-persist="linux" aria-controls="tabs-00-02" aria-selected="false"&gt;
 Linux
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class="tab-content" id="tabs-0-content"&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade show active"
 id="tabs-00-00" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-00-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Find &lt;code&gt;NeurodeskApp.app&lt;/code&gt; in Finder (in &lt;code&gt;/Applications&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;~/Applications&lt;/code&gt;) and move it to Trash (&lt;code&gt;CMD + Delete&lt;/code&gt;). Then remove application data:&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#f7f7f7;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;rm -rf ~/Library/neurodeskapp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;rm -rf ~/Library/Application&lt;span style="color:#0a3069"&gt;\ &lt;/span&gt;Support/neurodeskapp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-body tab-pane fade"
 id="tabs-00-01" role="tabpanel" aria-labelled-by="tabs-00-01-tab" tabindex="0"&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Go to &lt;strong&gt;Start Menu &amp;gt; Settings &amp;gt; Apps&lt;/strong&gt; and uninstall Neurodesk App.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To remove application cache, delete &lt;code&gt;C:\Users\&amp;lt;username&amp;gt;\AppData\Roaming\neurodeskapp&lt;/code&gt;. The AppData directory is hidden &amp;ndash; enable hidden items in Windows Explorer under &lt;strong&gt;View &amp;gt; Show &amp;gt; Hidden Items&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>